---
<section class="bg-warm-white px-6 py-28 md:py-32">
  <div class="fade-in-up mx-auto max-w-[960px] text-center">
    <!-- Label -->
    <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">
      The Difference
    </p>

    <!-- Lead text -->
    <h2
      class="mx-auto max-w-3xl font-serif font-normal leading-tight"
      style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;"
    >
      Dating apps optimized for engagement. We optimize for <span class="text-gold">actual connection.</span>
    </h2>

    <!-- Body copy -->
    <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
      Anora Club brings together thoughtful, high-agency people who are serious about building a rich social life — and open to meeting the right partner along the way.
    </p>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.75;">
      Through intimate events, curated introductions, and a trusted member community, we help people meet well.
    </p>

    <!-- Lifestyle image -->
    <div class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-3xl overflow-hidden rounded-2xl">
      <img
        src="/images/friends-laughing.jpg"
        alt="Friends laughing and connecting over drinks"
        class="h-auto w-full object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
